      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkang'wizīīla Hosea ng'witūnja o ng'wa Beeli mu shikū ja būsugi bo ng'wa Uzia, Yotamu, Ahazi na Hezekia, abo baalī batemi ba Yuda; na mu shikū ja būsugi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoashi ntemi wa Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nke o ng'wa Hosea na baana babo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA aho wandya kūlūngalūnga mu nzīla ya ng'wa Hosea; akang'wīla, “Jaga ūkipandīkīle nkīma malahya wa baana ba mu būmalahya; nguno ī sī īlī mu kwihīga kwa būmalahya būbi no kūlwa kūneka ū SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūja ūūkansola Gomeli nshīke o ng'wa Dibulaimu, atadīlile ūbūūcha nda ūmyalīla ng'wana ngosha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Hosea, “Ng'wilīkage ī lina lyakwe Yezileeli, nguno negeelaga kwīyinha nsango ī numba ya ng'wa Yehu kūlwa kūbabūlaga banhū mu Yezileeli, ū būtemi bo Isilaeli nakūbūpyagūla būshile ho gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ū būta bo ng'wa Isilaeli nakūbūbīnzagūlīla mu mbuga ya Yezileeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gomeli ūbūūcha nda hangī ūbyala ng'wana nkīma. Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Ng'wilīkage ī lina lyakwe Lo-Luhama,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lo-Luhama:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, Batantogilwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nguno natīchīla shigongo hangī ī numba ya Isilaeli, natūbalekeja nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī numba ya Yuda nakwīchīla shigongo, nakūbapīja; gwike ītī mu kūtūmamīla būta, nūūlū līlūshū, nūūlū būlūgū, nūūlū nguzu ja falasa na badamhīji baajo; alīyo mu nzīla ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wangija ū Lo-Luhama, ū Gomeli akabyala ng'wana ngosha hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba ūng'wīla, “Ng'wilīkage ī lina lyakwe Lo-Ami,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lo-Ami:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, Bati banhu bane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nguno mutī banhū bane, nū nene natī Mulungu wing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene a Baisilaeli bakūkwīla no babize gītī maseni ga ha nyanza, ayo gatadūgije kūgelekwa nūūlū kūsoloojiwa. Ū ng'wipandī īlo ng'wahayiagwa gīkī, “Mutī banhū bane,” bakwitanwa gīkī balī “Baana ba ng'wa Mulungu mpanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Yuda na a banhū ba Isilaeli bakwisangīja, hūna basole ntongeeji ūmò, na bakūkwīla hangī ū mu sī; nguno ū lūshikū lwa ng'wa Yezileeli lūlī lūtaale no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
